<Layouts.app flash={@flash}>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">ForecastLoop</h1>
  <p>
    A forecast ledger and model registry. A nightly batch runs the loop:
    narrative exploration → model construction → probabilistic forecasting →
    Forecast Integrity Protocol validation → predictability-collapse detection →
    model revision → repeat.
  </p>
  <p>
    Rules are PostgreSQL views in four groups: knowledge (<code>k_</code>), gaps (<code>gap_</code>),
    the forecasting cycle (<code>loop_</code>), and calibration (<code>cal_</code>).
    Domain packs give the domain-neutral core its meaning.
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6">
    <li :for={{label, path} <- Layouts.nav_links()}><a class="link" href={path}>{label}</a></li>
  </ul>
</Layouts.app>
